From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:00:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 39/40] PROTOTYPE pvr: pipeline cache key and bypass for the
 shared stack's switches

Local experiment for the shared amazon-suez/amazon-sheldonp stack, never to
be sent (Imagination declines LLM-generated code in src/imagination).

SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D is gone with the patch that hid image2DViewOf3D
(replaced by keying 2D-view-of-3D sampling on sampler2DViewOf3D, whose
state the key already covers through the enabled features); hash
PVR_NULL_TEX_CHECK instead, which changes what the compiler emits. Skip
the cache when PCO_DEBUG_PRINT is set, so the shaders are compiled and
printed (amazon-sheldonp's local patch 0034).

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_pipeline.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_pipeline.c b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_pipeline.c
index 125f7da88d3..fc11eefdba1 100644
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_pipeline.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_pipeline.c
@@ -3056,7 +3056,7 @@ pvr_gfx_pipeline_cache_key(const struct pvr_device *device,
 
    pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "PCO_DEBUG");
    pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "PVR_DEBUG");
-   pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D");
+   pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "PVR_NULL_TEX_CHECK");
    pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "SUEZ_PVR_CWE");
    pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "SUEZ_PCO_ALWAYS_ISP_FB");
    pvr_gfx_cache_hash_str(&ctx, "SUEZ_PCO_NO_FOLD_SAT");
@@ -3318,7 +3318,9 @@ pvr_graphics_pipeline_compile(struct pvr_device *const device,
       !(pCreateInfo->flags &
         (VK_PIPELINE_CREATE_CAPTURE_STATISTICS_BIT_KHR |
          VK_PIPELINE_CREATE_CAPTURE_INTERNAL_REPRESENTATIONS_BIT_KHR)) &&
-      !getenv("SUEZ_PVR_NO_PIPELINE_CACHE");
+      !getenv("SUEZ_PVR_NO_PIPELINE_CACHE") &&
+      /* A cache hit compiles nothing, so nothing would be printed. */
+      !getenv("PCO_DEBUG_PRINT");
    struct vk_pipeline_cache_object *cached = NULL;
    blake3_hash cache_key;
    pco_data cached_vs_data, cached_fs_data;
